    "description": "薬局のカウンターで、体調の悪そうな女性が薬剤師に症状を説明し、薬剤師が市販薬の箱を見せながら服用方法を説明している。近くでは別の客が棚の商品を見比べている場面。",
    "timeLimit": 30,
    "stage1": {
      "passage": "It is important for people to choose medicine carefully when they feel sick. Pharmacists can explain how to use medicine safely, answer questions about possible problems, and help customers find products that are suitable for their symptoms.",
      "q1": {
        "text": "How can pharmacists help customers who need medicine?",
        "keywords": [
          "explain medicine",
          "answer questions",
          "find products",
          "symptoms"
        ],
        "modelAnswers": [
          "They can explain how to use medicine, answer questions, and help customers find suitable products.",
          "Pharmacists can help people choose medicine that is suitable for their symptoms and explain how to use it safely."
        ]
      }
    },
    "stage3": {
      "questions": [
        {
          "text": "What do you usually do when you have a cold or do not feel well?",
          "keywords": [
            "cold",
            "medicine",
            "rest",
            "sleep",
            "doctor",
            "pharmacy",
            "water",
            "temperature",
            "home",
            "recover"
          ],
          "modelAnswers": [
            "When I have a cold, I usually take some medicine and get plenty of rest.",
            "I drink a lot of water and go to bed early when I do not feel well.",
            "If I have a high fever or feel very sick, I usually go to a doctor."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you think it is important to ask a pharmacist before taking unfamiliar medicine? Why?",
          "keywords": [
            "pharmacist",
            "medicine",
            "safe",
            "question",
            "advice",
            "instructions",
            "side effect",
            "health",
            "correct",
            "important"
          ],
          "modelAnswers": [
            "Yes, because a pharmacist can explain how to take the medicine safely.",
            "I think it is important because some medicines may have side effects or may not be suitable for everyone.",
            "Yes. Asking a pharmacist can help people use medicine correctly and avoid problems."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
